  pageNumber: 20
  noteTitle: 'Office Memos 2/4 Monitoring Incident:'
  noteContent: 'Date: xxxxxx. Time: xxxxxx. Reporter: Security Staff. Incident Description:
    During routine monitoring, an unknown figure was observed within the main hall.
    The figure was... highly irregular, seemed to be composed of flickering visuals,
    and had something resembling an old television screen in place of a head. It
    was moving towards the main staircase. Camera signal in that area was lost. The
    key to the emergency stairwell is located in Technicians'' Room B.'
